```glsl
vec3 n = objectNormal;
// build tangent basis
vec3 t1 = normalize(abs(n.y) < 0.9 ? cross(vec3(0,1,0), n) : cross(vec3(1,0,0), n));
vec3 t2 = cross(n, t1);
mat3 J = pokeJac(position);
vec3 T1 = t1 + J*t1;
vec3 T2 = t2 + J*t2;
vec3 nd = normalize(cross(T1,T2));
// ensure orientation
if (dot(nd, n) < 0.0) nd = -nd;
objectNormal = nd;
```
